button linked the two standalone how-to files, which have been redirect
stubs since the guides were folded into REAPER-GUIDE.md (v2.8.6). They now
deep-link the matching REAPER-GUIDE.md sections (4.1.1-4.1.12, 4.4). The
stubs stay in the repository only for images before v3.1.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
